sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Worker A
    participant R as Redis lease
    participant B as Worker B
    participant S as Resource
    A->>R: SET lock A NX PX 300
    R-->>A: Acquired
    Note over A: Long pause (> 300 ms)
    Note over R: A's lease expires
    B->>R: SET lock B NX PX 300
    R-->>B: Acquired
    B->>S: Write B
    S-->>B: Accepted
    Note over A: Worker resumes without lease
    A->>S: Write A (stale)
    S-->>A: Accepted (unsafe)
    Note over S: Final state = A, overwrites B
